flowchart LR
  Types[Promoted actual argument signature] --> Call[Original SysV caller staging]
  Call --> Save[Six GPR and eight SSE save slots]
  Named[Named arguments and hidden result pointer] --> Start[va.start initial offsets]
  Save --> Start
  Start --> Read[va_arg runtime bank checks]
  Read --> Registers[Both banks fit: reconstruct value]
  Read --> Stack[Whole argument overflow stack]
  Registers --> Advance[Advance used offsets]
  Stack --> Advance
  Advance --> Read
  Start --> Copy[va.copy independent cursor]
  Copy --> Read
  Advance --> End[va.end]
  Types --> VM[Independent source-order VM cursor]
  VM --> Check[Type, lifetime, exhaustion checks]
